ed, turn on puzzle assistance, or use dyslexic-friendly fonts as needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly interpretations of famous artwork (parody law please protect us)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, play as a cat detective (wearing a full suit and tie)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "There's only one detective to unravel this murder turned museum heist... and they're the cat's meow. Interrogate a &quot;colorful&quot; cast of suspects until they cough up hairballs... and the truth. Will you wrap up the case in time for an afternoon nap, and make injustice knead its last biscuit?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/46276b910ab79e2264ad8446c3c6c88ef5cc60a2/header.jpg?t=1778725622", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/e7e20e7c0a1bd0d5617825a31652906687f46ff6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778725622", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/e7e20e7c0a1bd0d5617825a31652906687f46ff6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778725622", "website": "https://nobodycrown.com/#ffmm", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Quadro K620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Quadro K620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "(c) 2024-26 Nobody Crown LTD. Developed 